{"id":"975b532ae73815ef","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-pcf2-revised-power.md","title":"ZFC Pcf2 Revised Power","display":"df-zfc-pcf2-revised-power — ZFC Pcf2 Revised Power","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-revised-power","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf2-revised-power"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf2-revised-power — ZFC Pcf2 Revised Power","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-revised-power"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf2-revised-power</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf2-revised-power — ZFC Pcf2 Revised Power"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda,\\theta,\\chi,X,\\nu\\in V\">\\(\\lambda,\\theta,\\chi,X,\\nu\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|X|\">\\(|X|\\)</span>（基数，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[X]^\\nu\\coloneqq\\{Y\\subseteq X\\mid |Y|=\\nu\\}\">\\([X]^\\nu\\coloneqq\\{Y\\subseteq X\\mid |Y|=\\nu\\}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[X]^{&lt;\\theta}\\coloneqq\\{Y\\subseteq X\\mid |Y|&lt;\\theta\\}\">\\([X]^{&lt;\\theta}\\coloneqq\\{Y\\subseteq X\\mid |Y|&lt;\\theta\\}\\)</span>（本文件使用的局部记号）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2RevisedPower}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2RevisedPower}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}revised\\text{-}power} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2RevisedPower}_S(\\lambda,\\theta,\\chi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\chi)\\land\n\\omega\\leq\\theta\\leq\\lambda\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C\\subseteq[\\lambda]^\\theta\\land |\\mathcal C|=\\chi\\land\n\\Bigl[\\forall X\\in[\\lambda]^\\theta\\;\n\\exists\\mathcal Q\\in[\\mathcal C]^{&lt;\\theta}\\;\n\\left(X\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal Q\\right)\\Bigr]\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal D\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Bigl[\\mathcal D\\subseteq[\\lambda]^\\theta\\land\n\\forall X\\in[\\lambda]^\\theta\\;\\exists\\mathcal Q\\in[\\mathcal D]^{&lt;\\theta}\\;\n(X\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal Q)\\Bigr]\n\\to\\chi\\leq|\\mathcal D|\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}revised\\text{-}power} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2RevisedPower}_S(\\lambda,\\theta,\\chi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\chi)\\land\n\\omega\\leq\\theta\\leq\\lambda\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C\\subseteq[\\lambda]^\\theta\\land |\\mathcal C|=\\chi\\land\n\\Bigl[\\forall X\\in[\\lambda]^\\theta\\;\n\\exists\\mathcal Q\\in[\\mathcal C]^{&lt;\\theta}\\;\n\\left(X\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal Q\\right)\\Bigr]\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal D\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Bigl[\\mathcal D\\subseteq[\\lambda]^\\theta\\land\n\\forall X\\in[\\lambda]^\\theta\\;\\exists\\mathcal Q\\in[\\mathcal D]^{&lt;\\theta}\\;\n(X\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal Q)\\Bigr]\n\\to\\chi\\leq|\\mathcal D|\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A witnessing cover family has size <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span>, and the final universal clause states its cardinal minimality. This avoids treating an undeclared <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min\">\\(\\min\\)</span> expression as a term.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V$（see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothes